.
.  Generate sample output for Poisson PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na poipdf.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Poisson PDF (Lambda = 5)
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability
X1LABEL X
LINE BLANK
SPIKE ON
XTIC OFFSET 1 1
.
PLOT POIPDF(X,5) FOR X = 0 1 20
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp POIPDF.PS poipdf.ps
system rm POIPDF.PS
.
quit
